# State, derived values and watchers (D56) driving a window: a click
# changes state, a watcher updates the window, a derived value follows.
create window into app
title of app is "Counter"
state clicks is 0
derive doubled is clicks times 2
create text into display
text of display is "clicks: 0"
create text into twice
text of twice is "doubled: 0"
create button into addButton
text of addButton is "Add one"
when clicks changes
    text of display is "clicks: " plus "?"
    text of display is clicks
    say "clicks changed to" clicks
.
when doubled changes
    text of twice is doubled
    say "doubled is" doubled
.
say "doubled starts at" doubled
when addButton is clicked
    add 1 to clicks
.
create text box into entry
state typed is ""
when typed changes
    say "typed is now" typed
.
when entry is changed
    typed is text of entry
.
put display, twice, addButton, entry in app
show app
say "final" clicks doubled typed
